WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.434
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.434 --> 00:00:03.834
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.834 --> 00:00:05.400
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.901
Ohio Congressman Jim Jordan

00:00:07.901 --> 00:00:09.567
failed to secure
enough votes today

00:00:09.567 --> 00:00:11.968
in the second round of voting
to become House Speaker,

00:00:11.968 --> 00:00:14.634
and received only 199 votes.

00:00:14.634 --> 00:00:16.801
That's worse
than he did yesterday.

00:00:16.801 --> 00:00:18.067
If they keep doing votes,

00:00:18.067 --> 00:00:20.067
he's eventually
gonna get to zero.

00:00:20.067 --> 00:00:23.534
And then he'll fade away like
Marty McFly in a family photo.

00:00:23.534 --> 00:00:24.701
[ Laughter ]

00:00:24.701 --> 00:00:26.033
The White House announced
last night

00:00:26.033 --> 00:00:28.067
that President Biden's
scheduled stop in Jordan

00:00:28.067 --> 00:00:29.467
has been canceled,

00:00:29.467 --> 00:00:32.801
making it the second Jordan
to get shut down this week.

00:00:32.801 --> 00:00:34.601
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:36.467
President Biden arrived
this morning in Israel,

00:00:36.467 --> 00:00:38.667
making him the first president
to visit Israel

00:00:38.667 --> 00:00:41.234
during a time of war,
which is pretty dangerous.

00:00:41.234 --> 00:00:44.567
But he should be okay once
he makes it down the stairs.

00:00:44.567 --> 00:00:46.567
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.734 --> 00:00:51.400
The Treasury Department
announced new sanctions today

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:53.901
against 10 entities
that are linked to Hamas,

00:00:53.901 --> 00:00:57.901
including the cryptocurrency
firm Buy Cash.

00:00:57.901 --> 00:01:01.434
Oh, uh, was a cryptocurrency
firm up to no good?

00:01:01.434 --> 00:01:03.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.033 --> 00:01:04.868
And it's called Buy Cash?

00:01:04.868 --> 00:01:07.801
"Hey, what's a good
non-suspicious name

00:01:07.801 --> 00:01:09.133
for a crypto firm?

00:01:09.133 --> 00:01:11.067
How about Buy Cash?"

00:01:11.067 --> 00:01:12.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.067 --> 00:01:13.901
If I drove past a strip mall

00:01:13.901 --> 00:01:17.234
and there was a store
called Buy Cash,

00:01:17.234 --> 00:01:20.234
I would lock my doors
and call the police.

00:01:20.234 --> 00:01:21.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.367 --> 00:01:23.868
Florida Congresswoman
Anna Paulina Luna

00:01:23.868 --> 00:01:25.934
reportedly brought
her newborn baby

00:01:25.934 --> 00:01:27.634
to yesterday's
House Speaker vote.

00:01:27.634 --> 00:01:29.667
Well, congratulations
to the new mom

00:01:29.667 --> 00:01:31.868
and the new Speaker!

00:01:31.868 --> 00:01:33.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.701 --> 00:01:36.367
Baby with a gavel!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:36.367 --> 00:01:38.067
Baby with a gavel.

00:01:39.801 --> 00:01:42.467
That's one of comedy's
first rules.

00:01:42.467 --> 00:01:45.467
Can't go wrong with a baby
with a gavel.

00:01:45.467 --> 00:01:47.801
Former President Trump yesterday
attacked the judge

00:01:47.801 --> 00:01:49.701
overseeing
his civil fraud trial,

00:01:49.701 --> 00:01:51.467
in a post on Truth Social,

00:01:51.467 --> 00:01:54.734
and said he's serving "as judge,
jury, and everything else."

00:01:54.734 --> 00:01:57.400
I'm guessing this was after
three failed attempts

00:01:57.400 --> 00:01:59.567
to spell executioner.

00:01:59.567 --> 00:02:01.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.701 --> 00:02:07.100
[As Trump] Judge, jury,
and big guy with ax and mask.

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:09.767
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.767 --> 00:02:11.100
-[Normal voice] That's right.

00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:13.334
Trump attacked the judge
overseeing his civil fraud trial

00:02:13.334 --> 00:02:15.901
despite being under
a partial gag order.

00:02:15.901 --> 00:02:17.234
Yeah, I don't think you can...

00:02:17.234 --> 00:02:18.567
Yeah, don't...
[ Gibberish ]

00:02:18.567 --> 00:02:20.300
[Bleep]

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:22.501
I know, I stumbled
on the wording earlier,

00:02:22.501 --> 00:02:24.734
and I didn't rewrite it,
and it's my fault.

00:02:24.734 --> 00:02:27.000
Okay, here we go.
Alright. Yeah.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:29.434
Let's go back and take it again.
It's definitely...

00:02:29.434 --> 00:02:31.067
This isn't gonna
throw it at all.

00:02:31.067 --> 00:02:32.567
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.567 --> 00:02:35.567
I don't -- I don't even think
they've noticed I flubbed up.

00:02:35.567 --> 00:02:37.901
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.901 --> 00:02:40.434
I've played it so smoothly.

00:02:40.434 --> 00:02:42.601
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.601 --> 00:02:44.434
That's right.
Trump attacked the judge

00:02:44.434 --> 00:02:45.934
overseeing his civil fraud trial

00:02:45.934 --> 00:02:47.634
despite being under
a partial gag order.

00:02:47.634 --> 00:02:49.834
Yeah, you don't think
you can shut Trump up

00:02:49.834 --> 00:02:52.200
with a partial gag order,
do you?

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:54.467
You can't even shut him up
with a full gag order.

00:02:54.467 --> 00:02:57.634
You could put them in the full
Hannibal Lecter outfit,

00:02:57.634 --> 00:03:00.367
and he would still find a way
to get the word out.

00:03:00.367 --> 00:03:02.534
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.534 --> 00:03:05.701
In an effort to reduce pollution
caused by microplastics,

00:03:05.701 --> 00:03:09.868
a European Union ban on the sale
of loose plastic glitter

00:03:09.868 --> 00:03:11.501
went into effect this week.

00:03:11.501 --> 00:03:13.334
Some great news that, sadly,

00:03:13.334 --> 00:03:15.334
there was no way to celebrate.

00:03:15.334 --> 00:03:17.434
[ Laughter ]

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:23.634
United Airlines
has reportedly decided

00:03:23.634 --> 00:03:25.801
to implement
a new boarding strategy

00:03:25.801 --> 00:03:29.801
that allows economy passengers
in window seats to board first.

00:03:29.801 --> 00:03:31.334
Meanwhile, Spirit Airlines

00:03:31.334 --> 00:03:33.267
has decided
to streamline boarding

00:03:33.267 --> 00:03:35.100
with a starting gun.

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:37.067
[ Laughter ]

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:42.968
The US Mint yesterday announced
that journalist Ida B. Wells

00:03:42.968 --> 00:03:44.968
will be honored
with her face on a quarter.

00:03:44.968 --> 00:03:46.501
Because what greater honor

00:03:46.501 --> 00:03:48.334
than being bounced
into a Solo cup

00:03:48.334 --> 00:03:50.133
by a drunk freshman?

00:03:50.133 --> 00:03:51.801
[ Laughter ]

00:03:51.801 --> 00:03:53.567
And finally, Netflix recently
unveiled plans

00:03:53.567 --> 00:03:55.100
for its first
live sports event,

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:57.567
which will feature
Formula One drivers and golfers

00:03:57.567 --> 00:03:59.901
teaming up to compete
in a golf tournament.

00:03:59.901 --> 00:04:02.734
So, if you love the intense,
high-speed excitement

00:04:02.734 --> 00:04:05.734
of Formula One racing,
get ready to strap yourself in

00:04:05.734 --> 00:04:07.234
for some golf.

00:04:07.234 --> 00:04:08.234
[ Laughter ]

00:04:08.234 --> 00:04:09.901
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

00:04:09.901 --> 00:04:12.300
We are off and running.

